<title>JAPAN: Moody's rates EIB dual samurai bond Aaa.</title>
<headline>Moody's rates EIB dual samurai bond Aaa.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Friday that it had assigned its Aaa rating to the European Investment Bank's 70 billion yen worth of 5.05 percent yen/dollar dual currency samurai bonds due in April 2000.</p>
</text>
